      en: ["Spans over 240 hectares of protected land in the city center", "Formerly a sacred forest for the traditional Mossi rulers", "Contains a botanical garden featuring over 300 plant species", "Houses an environmental museum and a small zoological area", "A primary venue for local sports and leisure activities", "Features an extensive network of trails for nature study"],
